-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",424,{
[13537]="7002C223\n1\tDerrota a centinelas nink-hai (total: 4)\030Derrota a hostigadores nink-hai (total: 3)\030Derrota a saqueadores nink-hai (total: 3)\tLa tribu de orcos vándalos se encuentra al sudoeste del Cuthstan. Lanbert te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de orcos de la tribu con la esperanza de expulsarlos de la región.\n2\tHabla con Lanbert en el campamento del Cuthstan\tLanbert se encuentra en el campamento Rohirrim al pie del Cuthstan. Has reducido el número de la tribu orca y Lanbert espera tu regreso.\n",
[13538]="7001ABE8\n1\tDerrota a Dirk Espino\tDirk Espino está en el lado sur del muro en ruinas, al pie de las colinas que rodean las Quebradas de los Túmulos, al este del campamento de Adso. Adso teme que el líder bandido, Dirk Espino, regrese y mate a sus trabajadores durante la noche, y te pidió que te ocuparas de esta amenaza antes de que cumpla su amenaza.\n2\tHabla con Adso Henoloma\tAdso espera tu regreso en su campamento junto al Gran Camino del Este. Los bandidos en el muro en ruinas demostraron no ser una verdadera amenaza y fueron eliminados con facilidad.\n",
[13539]="700588A9\n1\tDefeat Grush-and-Flak\tA fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been attacking a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.\n2\tDefeat Grush-and-Flak\tThe fearsome two-headed troll Grush-and-Flak has been attacking a wide array of troops throughout the countryside. Find the creature and drive it from the battlefield.\n3\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tLet Hlóthi know that Grush-and-Flak has been driven off.\n",
[13540]="700588A7\n1\tDefeat Hoshkhor\tHoshkhor, has become known to the gathered forces of Gabil'akkâ. This foul captain has routed several patrols throughout the area and has hindered supply lines for the war effort.\n2\tDefeat Hoshkhor\tHoshkhor has become known to the gathered forces of Gabil'akkâ. This foul creature has routed several patrols throughout the area and has hindered supply lines for the war effort.\n3\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tHoshkhor has become known to the gathered forces of Gabil'akkâ. This foul creature has routed several patrols throughout the area and has hindered supply lines for the war effort.\n",
[13541]="700588A8\n1\tDefeat Mozlut\tMozlut is an enormous Warg who has been rampaging across the battlefield. Drive off this foul beast.\n2\tDefeat Mozlut\tMozlut is an enormous Warg who has been rampaging across the battlefield. Drive off this foul beast.\n3\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tFind Hlóthi and inform him that you were able to drive off the beast.\n",
[13542]="700588A6\n1\tDefeat Svalblóth\tA foul drake that goes by Svalblóth has emerged from Gundabad. The survivors from several patrols claim that this creature ate half of their group and continued to maraud across the battlefield.\n2\tDrive off Svalblóth\tA foul drake that goes by Svalblóth has emerged from Gundabad. The survivors from several patrols claim that this creature ate half of their group and continued to maraud across the battlefield.\n3\tSpeak to Hlóthi\tWith Svalblóth driven off, return to Hlóthi, and let him know that deed has been done.\n",
[13543]="7005AAAC\n1\tComplete 'The Tombs of Akhaldarâg' from Ausma\030Complete 'Lair of the Frost-horde' from Ausma\030Complete 'The Camps of Stazg Vozag' from Ausma\tScout-master Ausma's apprentices have been sent to points of interest around the Pit of Stonejaws. You should find Kyrstig, Molkha, and Klúso and assist them with their missions.\n2\tTalk to Scout-master Ausma\tYou have aided the dwarf scouts with their missions. You should talk to Scout-master Ausma in Bárgstad.\n",
[13544]="7005AAF4\n1\tDefeat Orc-kind in Thyrstáth (total: 15)\tThe Orcs and hobgoblins are engaged in a battle in the ice-giant settlement. You should defeat Orc-kind in Thyrstáth.\n2\tCall Hórin and talk to him\tUse the summoning horn to call Hórin to your side. You should talk to Hórin.\n",
[13545]="7004A39C\n1\tHail the Easterlings before Rhûd Vorn\tYou should hail the Easterlings as Kurtil taught you before their camp, Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.\n2\tTalk to the Easterling Lord\tYou should talk to the Easterling Lord who responded to your hailing, outside Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.\n3\tFind the great banner\030Find the letter\030Bring Yordam to the Black Gate\tYou should lead Yordam the Easterling to a view of the Black Gates, the Great Flag on the parade grounds, and seek the letter dispatched to Maudhúl Vôr. If you get separated from Yordam, wind his horn to call him back to you.\n4\tTalk to Yordam\tNow that you have found the fallen banner, the dead letter-bearer, and the Black Gates broken, you should talk to Yordam. If you get separated from Yordam, wind his horn to call him back to you.\n5\tReturn to Khôpol\tNow that you have collected the proofs, you should return to Khôpol before Rhûd Vorn, on the northern slopes of Udûn.\n6\tReturn to Kurtil\tHaving secured the pledge from the Easterling Lord Khôpol, you should return to Kurtil and the other forge-workers where they had been, on the height above Maudhúl Vôr.\n",
[13546]="7000F1DC\n1\tEncuentra la primera partitura de Burgthryth\tBurgthryth cree que la primera de sus partituras fue sacada de su mochila por un oso de la tundra. Tendrás que dar caza a estos animales hasta que encuentres al que se la robó, suponiendo que no la haya devorado ya. Los osos de la tundra pueden encontrarse en la tundra de Länsi-mâ.\n2\tEncuentra la segunda partitura de Burgthryth\tBurgthryth te ha dicho que un peikko curioso podría haber cogido la segunda partitura de su himno mientras ella tocaba. Tendrás que dar caza al peikko que se la robó. Hay muchos peikko en una pequeña cueva al este de Zigilgund.\n3\tEncuentra la tercera partitura de Burgthryth\tBurgthryth piensa que probablemente la tercera partitura de su himno se le cayó cuando era perseguida por cazadores Gauredain. Tendrás que dar caza a los Gauredain y recuperar esa partitura antes de que la usen como pañuelo... o algo peor. Los Gauredain pueden encontrarse en la tundra de Länsi-mâ.\n4\tLlévale a Burgthryth las partituras de su himno a Jänis-leiri\tBurgthryth está en Jänis-leiri. Has encontrado todas las partituras perdidas del himno de Burgthryth. Deberías devolvérselas cuanto antes.\n",
[13547]="7001758D\n1\tRegresa con Dithrik en las Fundaciones de Piedra\030Recoge cabezas de Sinnombre (total: 12)\tLos seres Sinnombre y la antigua criatura merodean por los alrededores de las Fundaciones de Piedra, especialmente hacia el sureste de esta región. Dithrik te ha pedido que recojas doce cabezas intactas de los Sin Nombre de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\n",
[13548]="7004CF01\n1\tHabla con Karst\tAl completar esta misión, completarás automáticamente cualquier hazaña meta del Trono del Terror Temible que esté incompleta y recibirás fichas de incursión y monedas antiguas de Ithil.\n",
[13549]="7003081D\n1\tDerrota a los orcos montados cerca de la Muralla del Este (total: 6)\tSe pueden encontrar jinetes orcos cerca del arroyo al noroeste de Walstow y a lo largo de los lados del camino hacia el oeste hasta Río Nevado.\n2\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a los jinetes montados y has repelido el asalto renovado desde la Muralla del Este.\n",
[13550]="70046C3E\n1\tFollow the western roadway northward from Cair Andros\tCair Andros can be found on the Anduin in north-western North Ithilien and its road leads northward towards Dagorlad. Jarl Gurthilm has asked you to follow the western roadway northward through Ithilien and follow his company to the Khundolar encampment.\n2\tFollow the roadway northward towards Dagorlad\tThe roadway north can be found far to north-west of Henneth Annûn. You are following the roadway and should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.\n3\tContinue to follow the roadway towards Dagorlad\tThe roadway north can be found far to north-west of Henneth Annûn. You are following the roadway and should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.\n4\tFollow the roadway eastward towards Uya Hujûm\tThe roadway travels eastward through North Ithilien can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn. The roadway has forked eastward and you should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.\n5\tFollow the roadway eastward towards Uya Hujûm\tThe roadway travels eastward through North Ithilien can be found to the north of Henneth Annûn. The roadway has forked eastward and you should continue to follow Jarl Gurthilm's company to the Khundolar encampment.\n6\tFind Jarl Gurthilm and his company near Uya Hujûm\tJarl Gurthilm and his company can be found to the south-east of Uya Hujûm. You have followed Jarl Gurthilm's company to a trail of dead and should now seek the Variag company nearby.\n7\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm outside Uya Hujûm\tJarl Gurthilm can be found in north-eastern North Ithilien at the foot of Uya Hujûm. You have found Jarl Gurthilm and his company and should now speak to him.\n",
[13551]="70044E41\n1\tHabla con Rhus Cornchúthur en la entrada de Maur Tulhau\030Habla con Iola Isbrun en la entrada de Maur Tulhau\tBingo se está despidiendo de los hobbits de Maur Tulhau y dijo que se reuniría contigo en la salida sur del pueblo.\n2\tHabla con Bingo en la entrada de Maur Tulhau\tBingo está en la entrada de Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos. Bingo ya se ha despedido y ahora está listo para continuar su viaje hacia el norte.\n3\tHabla con Bingo en la entrada de Maur Tulhau y continúa el viaje hacia el norte\tBingo está en la entrada de Maur Tulhau, en los Valles Sombríos. Bingo ya se ha despedido y ahora está listo para continuar su viaje hacia el norte.\n4\tHabla con Bingo en Andrath\tBingo ha atravesado el bloqueo y ahora se encuentra en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.\n5\tHabla con Teodoro Tojo en Andrath\030Habla con Haley Pradodulce en Andrath\tHaley Pradodulce y Teodoro Tojo se encuentran ahora en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.\n6\tHabla con Bingo en Andrath\tBingo se encuentra ahora en Andrath, en el extremo sur de las Tierras de Bree.\n",
[13552]="7004E1DB\n1\tTalk to Arcah\tArcah can be found at Ravenhill. After learning that some of Arcah's ravens have begun to return from their spying, King Thorin III has asked you to seek the counsel of Arcah at Ravenhill.\n2\tThe missing ravens can likely be found in the heights of Eryn Lasgalen and Dale or somewhere near the banks of the River Running. After they each failed to answer her call, Arcah has asked you to seek three ravens in the lands of the North and send them to Ravenhill.\t\n3\tTalk to Arcah at Ravenhill\tArcah can be found at Ravenhill. You found the ravens who failed to answer Arcah's call and should now return to her with these tidings.\n4\tFind the raven that spied upon the Grey Mountains\tThe missing raven would have flown from the Grey Mountains, so it can likely be found somewhere among the north-western slopes of Erebor. After it failed to return from spying in the Grey Mountains, Arcah has asked you to seek a lost raven on the slopes of Erebor.\n5\tExamine the wounded raven\tThe raven who spied the Grey Mountains can be found upon the western slopes of Erebor. You have found the lost raven and should now examine it.\n6\tTalk to Arcah at Ravenhill\tArcah can be found at Ravenhill. You were able to rescue the raven that spied upon the Grey Mountains. You should now return to Arcah.\n7\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have learned that Vethúg Wintermind has stirred in the Grey Mountains and now prepares to fly for Erebor. You should inform King Thorin III at once.\n",
[13553]="70015E1C\n1\tBusca señales de la Compañía\030Encuentra la torre en la colina\tLa torre se encuentra en una colina, al suroeste de Limlaer, que se encuentra cerca del camino que conduce al suroeste desde Echad Dúnann. Limlaer te ha pedido que vayas a una torre cercana y mires señales del paso de la Compañía.\n2\tHabla con Limlaer\tLimlaer se encuentra al suroeste de Echad Dúnann, a lo largo del camino de Nan Sirannon. Debes informar tus hallazgos a Limlaer.\n",
[13554]="70046C01\n1\tAid Thurindol with as many of his tasks as you are able, and when you are ready to move on, meet him at Aelin Veren\tThurindol can be found at Aelin Veren, far to the north of the Cross-roads in North Ithilien. Thurindol has asked you to aid him with a few tasks before meeting him at the baths of Aelin Veren.\n2\tAid the Rangers at Aelin Veren as much as you are able, and when you are ready to move on, meet Thurindol along the road to the north\tAelin Veren can be found in central North Ithilien. You have arrived at Aelin Veren to find a party of Rangers in need of aid. Thurindol has asked you to aid them before meeting him further north along the road.\n3\tHeed the Ranger's orders\tDornach is standing along the main roadway in central North Ithilien. A Ranger named Dornach has asked you to heed his orders if you wish to travel to Henneth Annûn.\n4\tTalk to Thurindol at Henneth Annûn\tThurindol can be found within Henneth Annûn in north-central North Ithilien. You have been brought to Henneth Annûn by Dornach and should now seek out Thurindol.\n",
[13555]="7005296A\n1\tTalk to Gírta\030Talk to Sterkist\030Talk to Varthmath\030Talk to Hállkell\tGírta, Sterkist, Varthmath, and Hállkell can all be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands. You should talk to Gírta, Sterkist, Varthmath, and Hállkell before you set out to explore the Vale.\n2\tScout the entrance to the Floodfells\030Scout Ylgraf\030Find a suitable trophy from Ylgraf\030Find a suitable trophy from near the Floodfells\tThe entrance to the Floodfells and Ylgraf can be found at the northern edge of the Beorning-lands. You should scout the entrance to the Floodfells and Ylgraf for Grimbeorn.\n3\tBring the trophies to Grimbeorn\tGrimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorninglands. You should talk to Grimbeorn.\n",
[13556]="70028252\n1\tDerrota a los espectros cerca de Plas-maru (total: 10)\030Derrota al Asgurn-capten\tPlas-maru se encuentra al este del campamento de Ilar. Ilar te ha pedido que derrotes a los espectros que custodian la entrada a Plas-maru y que acabes con su capitán.\n2\tHabla con Ilar en su campamento en el Valle de los Huesos\tIlar se encuentra en su campamento, al oeste de Plas-maru. Infórmale a Ilar de tu victoria contra los espectros.\n",
[13557]="70034C1E\n1\tAyuda a Oter a preparar la granja de Thrymm\tSe han iniciado los trabajos para reparar la granja de Thrymm y ya casi es hora de empezar a trabajar en los campos.\n2\tHabla con Gárwig\tLa granja de Thrymm fue quemada hasta los cimientos, y los agricultores fueron capturados por el teniente de Núrzum, Laudh. Se debe informar a Gárwig de lo sucedido.\n",
[13558]="70035A72\n1\tLimpia el desorden de la Granja de Thrymm (total: 6)\tSe puede llegar a la Granja de Thrymm hablando con Dudoc para viajar allí. Deberías ir a la Granja de Thrymm y limpiar el desastre que dejaron los uruk-hai errantes.\n2\tVuelve con Dudoc en Forlaw\tDudoc está en Forlaw. Deberías volver con Dudoc.\n",
[13559]="7003593C\n1\tDerrota a jinetes uruk en la Granja de Thrymm (total: 10)\tPuedes llegar a la Granja de Thrymm hablando con Dudoc para viajar allí. Debes ir a la Granja de Thrymm y hacer retroceder a los uruks que ahora deambulan libremente por allí.\n2\tVuelve con Dudoc en Forlaw\tPuedes encontrar a Dudoc en Forlaw. Debes volver con Dudoc.\n",
[13560]="7004E40D\n1\tDerrota a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 1\tTe has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng. ¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!\n2\tCompletado\tCompletado.\n",
[13561]="700537CE\n1\tDerrota a Thrâng en el límite de nivel del Nivel 2\tTe has encontrado en la arena de Thrâng. ¡Debes derrotar a Thrâng!\n2\tCompletado\tCompletado.\n",
[13562]="70027E97\n1\tQuema los barriles explosivos (total: 4)\tLos barriles de fuego negro de los trasgos se encuentran cerca de los hornos de fundición en las minas. Ondor te ha pedido que quemes el polvo negro explosivo de los trasgos.\n2\tHabla con el enano Ondor en las minas de los orcos\tEl enano Ondor está en las minas de los orcos. Vuelve con Ondor para contarle que has tenido éxito.\n",
[13563]="7003EB0A\n1\tDerrota Trolls de Piedra en el Sur del Bosque de los Trolls (total: 8)\tHay trolls de piedra acampados al norte del camino principal en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls. Mientras estés en el sur del Bosque de los Trolls, deberías encargarte de los trolls de piedra que se han asentado allí.\n",
[13564]="700001EB\n1\tPárate sobre la Mesa de los Gigantes\tEl Señor del Trueno gobierna a los gigantes desde Iorbar, al sur y al este de la Mesa de los Gigantes, en las Montañas Nubladas. El Señor del Trueno es la fuente de la reciente hostilidad de los gigantes, y debe ser derrotado antes de que todos los gigantes de la región obedezcan sus órdenes. Necesitarás la ayuda de valientes aliados si esperas vencerlo.\n2\tDerrota al Señor del Trueno\tEl Señor del Trueno gobierna a los gigantes desde Iorbar, al sur y al este de la Mesa de los Gigantes, en las Montañas Nubladas. El Señor del Trueno es la fuente de la reciente hostilidad de los gigantes, y debe ser derrotado antes de que todos los gigantes de la región obedezcan sus órdenes. Necesitarás la ayuda de valientes aliados si esperas vencerlo.\n3\tHabla con Golhador en el campamento del Risco Alto\tGolhador está en el campamento del Risco Alto, en las Montañas Nubladas, al noreste de Rivendel. Deberías regresar con Golhador y hacerle saber que el Señor del Trueno ha sido derrotado.\n",
[13565]="7005B193\n1\tTravel to Zirakazhâr\tDwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir can be found at Zirakazhâr on the slopes of Zirakzigil to the north-west of Amdân. Dáin has asked you to travel to Zirakazhâr and aid the Dwarves of the Haban'akkâ.\n2\tTalk to King Agni the Wild\030Talk to King Drógar Bloodwhisker\030Talk to King Jegín\tKing Agni the Wild, King Drógar Bloodwhisker, and King Jegín can be found at Zirakazhâr. You have arrived at Zirakazhâr. You should speak to the Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir leading the assault on Rung-shakam.\n3\tScout Rung-shakam\tRung-shakam can be found to the north-west of Zirakazhâr. The Kings of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir have asked you to scout Rung-shakam and defeat Azog's forces upon Zirakzigil.\n4\tDefeat Moria-trolls at Rung-shakam (total: 6)\030Tambores orcos destruidos en Rung-shakam (total: 6)\030Collect trophy-bones (total: 7)\tTrolls of Moria and Orkish drums can be found at Rung-shakam. Trophy-bones can be collected from Orcs and some goblins at Rung-shakam. You should aid the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir by defeating the Moria-trolls at Rung-shakam. You should also destroy Orkish drums and collect trophy-bones for the Haban'akkâ.\n5\tRaise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam\tYou have done much to hinder Azog's forces at Rung-shakam. You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Rung-shakam.\n6\tCompletado\tYou have done much to aid the Dwarves of the Landorrim, Narfanghoth, and Temámir at Rung-shakam.\n",
[13566]="70071B33\n1\tDefeat sûlokil in An Shêru (total: 8)\tYou should defeat sûlokil in An Shêru. A herd can be found gathering at the Beast-fields in the south-eastern part of the region.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have culled some of the sûlokil in An Shêru, making it easier for the others to survive in this harsh wasteland.\n",
[13567]="7000F1D4\n1\tEncuentra a la sierpe Beleganc y recupera la flecha de Thurmaer de su cuerpo\tBeleganc vaga a lo largo y ancho del gran glaciar, al sur de Kuru-leiri. Thurmaer te ha pedido que des caza a la sierpe de las nieves llamada Beleganc y recuperes su flecha de la suerte de ella.\n2\tDeuvelve la flecha a Thurmaer en Kuru-leiri\tThurmaer se encuentra en Kuru-leiri, al norte del glaciar. Deberías devolverle la flecha a Thurmaer.\n",
[13568]="70045418\n1\tDefeat Mordor spies (total: 10)\tSpying Orcs can be found in the woods of Taur Drúadan. You should defeat Mordor spies.\n2\tSpeak with Herefara\tHerefara can be found in the War-stead of the Helmingas. You should speak with Herefara.\n",
})
